1
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:15,900
Is it something that people believe?

2
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,320
A fact is anything that can be proved.

3
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:27,380
For example, it can be proved that China has more people than any other country in the world.

4
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,720
This is a fact.

5
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:32,880
Then what is an opinion?

6
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:38,940
An opinion is what someone believes is true but has not been proved.

7
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:43,620
So an opinion is not good evidence in a trial.

8
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:51,300
For example, it is an opinion if you say "Cats are better pets than dogs".

9
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:55,980
It may be true, but it is difficult to prove.

10
00:00:55,980 --> 00:01:01,160
Some people may not agree with this opinion but they also cannot prove

11
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,760
that they are right.

12
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:08,540
In a trial, a judge must decide which eyewitnesses to believe

13
00:01:08,540 --> 00:01:10,300
and which not to believe.

14
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:15,560
The judge does not consider what each eyewitness looks like or where

15
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:17,420
that person lives or works.

16
00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:32,240
This kind of information is called evidence.

17
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:46,100
In April 1945 I heard something explode at midnight.

18
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:48,960
I got up and ran outside.

19
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:54,220
The sound came from a mine that hadn’t been used for a long time.

20
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:59,040
Suddenly I saw some German soldiers by the light of the moon.

21
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:04,720
They were taking wooden boxes from trucks and putting them in the mine.

22
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:08,980
A week later I decided to go and see for myself.

23
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:13,420
To my surprise the entrance to the mine was closed.

24
00:02:13,420 --> 00:02:18,780
Some people say that the Amber Room and some gold were buried in the mine.

25
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:23,800
I think it might be so, as the Amber Room has never been found.
